config MOTOR_CONTROL
	bool "Per-motor control core ported from CanMotorMbed"
	depends on CPP && STD_CPP17
	select FIBRIL_COMMON
	help
	  DUTY, SPEED, POSITION and cascaded SPEED_POSITION control with the
	  CanMotorMbed feed-forward and friction terms, a duty slew limit and
	  the encoder stall breaker. The caller samples the encoder and drives
	  the motor; the core only turns one into the other, once per 1 ms
	  tick.
